# Files rsconnect must never upload.
#
# R/manifest.R and generate_manifest.R hand writeManifest() an explicit list of
# files, so a deployment made the intended way never consults this file at all.
# It is the belt-and-braces for anyone who deploys straight from the RStudio
# button, or with rsconnect::deployApp(), where the whole directory goes up.
#
# .RData and .Rhistory are the reason this file exists: they are an R session's
# saved workspace and command history. If a dataset was loaded when the
# workspace was written, deploying the directory uploads respondent data to a
# hosted server.
.RData
.Rhistory
.Rproj.user
.git
.gitignore
tests
# outputs/ was removed from the repository in November 2026 - nothing in the app
# ever wrote to it. The entry stays anyway: keeping it costs one line, and
# having dropped it would cost whatever a future local run leaves in a folder
# of that name.
outputs
docs/loa-schema.md
R/manifest.R
R/generate_manifest.R
generate_manifest.R
manifest.json
